    "_note": "svelte2tsx names a slot after the raw text of the first value chunk of its first `name` attribute: a `{...}` value or `{name}` shorthand has none, so the slot is keyed `undefined`, and those attributes are never slot props. A component whose slots then lack `default` gets no `children` widening, so default content given to a prop-less one is TS2322 against `never`."
